# Harmonize {4}{R} with only four sources of mana (Mountain, Mox Ruby, Mox Pearl, Mox Jet): not payable in full, but Bot1 may tap an
# untapped creature as the cost is chosen, and the total cost is reduced by generic mana equal to its power (CR 702.180a). Ragavan has
# power 2, so the total is {2}{R}: paid with the Mountain, Pearl and Jet, leaving Mox Ruby untapped, and Ragavan is tapped as the cost
# is paid (CR 702.180b). Bot2's Ornithopter is a creature but not Bot1's, so it is not offered (refused beside the Ragavan control).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Ragavan, Nimble Pilferer
Wild Ride
Ornithopter
Mountain x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Ornithopter
Island x18

